    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one thing though, the book uses some pretty harsh racial language and depicts the native populations in a very specific way—does the book actually critique how those people are portrayed, or is that just how the era's literature functioned? just trying to figure out how to frame the discussion on the language used in the text.",
